# 
# CURRENT ISSUE: Using regular password instead of App Password
# 
# TO FIX EMAIL DELIVERY:
# 1. Enable 2FA: https://myaccount.google.com/security
# 2. Generate App Password: https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
#    - Select app: Mail
#    - Select device: Other (Custom name) → "DXZ Data Manager"
#    - Copy the 16-character password (remove spaces)
# 3. Replace EMAIL_PASS above with the app password
# 4. Restart the server: npm run dev
# 
# Example App Password: abcdefghijklmnop (16 characters, no spaces)
# 
# Alternative Solutions:
# - Check spam/junk folder
# - Verify Gmail allows "Less secure app access" (not recommended)
# - Use different email service (SendGrid, Mailgun)
